# Direct mode: leave EGRESS_PROXY_URL unset.
#
# Proxy egress is currently unavailable in this Worker build. If configured,
# the Worker returns 502 proxy_unavailable instead of falling back to direct.
# Planned forms (do not commit real credentials):
# EGRESS_PROXY_URL=http://proxy.example:8080
# EGRESS_PROXY_URL=socks5://proxy.example:1080
#
# For a future deployment, set the value as a Worker Secret:
# wrangler secret put EGRESS_PROXY_URL
